<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>启动流量 - 标签 - DebugTalk</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/tags/%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F/</link><description>DebugTalk</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-mukxzari</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</managingEditor><webMaster>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:47:32 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debugtalk.com/tags/%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Android App持续集成性能测试：启动流量（1）</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/Android-performance-test-start-traffic-uid-stat/</link><pubDate>Tue, 03 May 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/Android-performance-test-start-traffic-uid-stat/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Testing/">Testing</category><description>&lt;p&gt;本文对Android App的启动流量测试进行介绍。这里的启动流量指的是网络流量，即App在启动时发起网络请求和接收网络响应时传输的网络数据量。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Android App持续集成性能测试：启动流量（2）</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/Android-performance-test-start-traffic-tcpdump-wireshark/</link><pubDate>Tue, 03 May 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/Android-performance-test-start-traffic-tcpdump-wireshark/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Testing/">Testing</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在上一篇文章中，介绍了一种测试Android App启动流量的方法。当时也提到了，通过读取&lt;code&gt;/proc/uid_stat/&amp;lt;UID&amp;gt;/&lt;/code&gt;目录下的&lt;code&gt;tcp_rcv&lt;/code&gt;和&lt;code&gt;tcp_snd&lt;/code&gt;文件，只能得到App的流量总值，无法得到更细化的数据。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>